---
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Hunting Flute - Untamed Weapons</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="container">
				<a href="/" class="logo">UNTAMED</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="/rules">Rules</a>
					<a href="/quick-reference">Quick Reference</a>
					<a href="/character">Characters</a>
					<a href="/bestiary">Bestiary</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/character">← Back to Character Creation</a>
				</div>

				<header class="page-header">
					<div class="weapon-icon"><img src="/weapons/Flute.png" alt="Hunting Flute" /></div>
					<h1>Hunting Flute</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">Support / Buffer</p>
					<div class="stat-badges">
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 CHA</span>
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 INS</span>
					</div>
				</header>

				<article class="content">
					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Overview</h2>
						<p>The Hunting Flute is a ranged support weapon designed to inspire allies and disrupt monsters through enchanting melodies. With its unique mechanic of Ballads, the Hunting Flute provides consistent buffs, debuffs, and crowd control while maintaining the ability to deal dissonant sound-based damage. Skilled players can balance between supporting the team and strategically applying debuffs to monsters.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Weapon Attributes</h2>
						<div class="attributes-grid">
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Tags</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Ranged (song auras)</li>
									<li>AoE (notes)</li>
									<li>Concentration (Ballads)</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Range</h3>
								<p>30-ft aura centered on self</p>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Save DC</h3>
								<p class="formula">10 + CHA mod + proficiency</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section highlight">
						<h2>Basic Attack — Sonic Note</h2>
						<p>You release a pulse of sound that rattles foes without friendly fire.</p>
						<div class="mechanic-details">
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Range/Shape:</strong> 30-ft aura centered on you. Choose up to <strong>2 targets</strong> in the aura (T3: up to 3; T5: up to 4).</li>
								<li><strong>Hit:</strong> Weapon damage (tier dice) + CHA modifier vs AR.</li>
								<li><strong>On a crit:</strong> Target has Disadvantage on its next Concentration check before your next turn.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section highlight">
						<h2>Core Mechanic — Ballads</h2>
						<p>Ballads are magical melodies that augment allies or hinder enemies depending on the song being played. The Hunting Flute's effectiveness hinges on playing these songs while maintaining concentration.</p>
						<div class="mechanic-details">
							<h3>Ballad Rules</h3>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Play a Ballad:</strong> Fast Action, costs 1 Stamina to start. You can attack while playing.</li>
								<li><strong>Upkeep:</strong> Pay 1 Stamina at the start of each of your turns while it's active.</li>
								<li><strong>Switch Ballad:</strong> Fast Action. New song immediately replaces the old one.</li>
								<li><strong>Concentration:</strong> If you lose Concentration, the song ends. Make a CHA check vs damage taken (DC = 10 or half damage, whichever is higher).</li>
								<li><strong>One active Ballad at a time</strong> — unless a technique allows more.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Damage Dice per Tier</h2>
						<table class="damage-table">
							<thead>
								<tr>
									<th>Tier</th>
									<th>Sonic Note Damage</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>1d6 + CHA</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>1d8 + CHA</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>2d6 + CHA</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 4</td><td>2d8 + CHA</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 5</td><td>3d6 + CHA</td></tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Techniques by Tier</h2>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T1 — Tempo Change</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Passive</div>
							</div>
							<p>You master the rhythm between melodies, using musical flow for evasive repositioning.</p>
							<ul>
								<li>When you switch Ballads, gain <strong>+10 ft movement</strong> and you don't provoke opportunity attacks during that movement.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T2 — Echo Pulse</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Passive</div>
							</div>
							<p>Your sustained melodies begin to ripple outward, extending their reach.</p>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Ballad radius +10 ft</strong> — most songs now reach 40 ft.</li>
								<li><strong>Chip Beat:</strong> Each hostile that starts its turn inside your active Ballad takes <strong>1d4 sonic damage</strong> (once per creature per round).</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T3 — Dissonant Crescendo</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">2 Stamina • Reaction • 1/round</div>
							</div>
							<p>Your melody fractures into dissonance, punishing those who challenge your song.</p>
							<p><strong>Trigger:</strong> A hostile enters your Ballad area, or makes an attack while inside it.</p>
							<p><strong>Effect:</strong> 15-ft radius burst within your Ballad area. Each enemy in the burst takes your weapon damage and must make a <strong>CHA save vs your Flute DC</strong> or lose its next attack roll (the attack action is wasted).</p>
							<p><em>Escalating Resistance applies to this effect vs the same creature.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T4 — Harmonic Resonance</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Passive</div>
							</div>
							<p>You can now layer melodies like a master conductor.</p>
							<ul>
								<li>You may maintain <strong>two Ballads at once</strong>.</li>
								<li>You have <strong>advantage on all Concentration saves</strong>.</li>
								<li>Stamina upkeep doubles (2/turn) while sustaining multiple songs.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T5 — Magnum Opus</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">4 Stamina/turn • Fast Action • 1/hunt</div>
							</div>
							<p>You unleash your most potent arrangement, weaving multiple songs with effortless flow.</p>
							<p><strong>Tags:</strong> Aura, Concentration</p>
							<p><strong>Activate/Deactivate:</strong> Fast Action.</p>
							<p><strong>While active:</strong></p>
							<ul>
								<li>You may maintain <strong>up to 3 Ballads at once</strong>.</li>
								<li>Individual Ballad upkeep becomes <strong>0</strong> — you only pay Magnum Opus's 4 STA/turn upkeep.</li>
								<li>You have advantage on CHA-based saves and checks tied to playing or concentration.</li>
								<li>Switching Ballads is still a Fast Action.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Ends if:</strong> You can't pay the upkeep, you lose Concentration, or you deactivate it (no action required).</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Starter Hunting Flutes</h2>

						<div class="flute-card aggressive">
							<div class="flute-header">
								<h3>🦴 Bone Flute</h3>
								<span class="flute-tag">Aggressive</span>
							</div>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Blood Rhythm</strong> (ally aura): Allies in range deal <strong>+1 damage</strong> on melee attacks.</li>
								<li><strong>Predator Pulse</strong> (ally aura): Allies in range gain <strong>+2 to attack rolls</strong>.</li>
							</ul>
							<p class="playstyle-note">Playstyle: crack high-AR checks and push damage.</p>
						</div>

						<div class="flute-card defensive">
							<div class="flute-header">
								<h3>🌿 Song Flute</h3>
								<span class="flute-tag">Defensive</span>
							</div>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Soothing Tones</strong> (ally aura): At the end of each ally's turn, that ally regains HP equal to your <strong>CHA modifier</strong> (min 1) while in range.</li>
								<li><strong>Earthen Refrain</strong> (ally aura): Allies in range gain <strong>+1 AR</strong> and advantage vs forced movement.</li>
							</ul>
							<p class="playstyle-note">Playstyle: stabilize lines, protect kite compositions.</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section playstyle">
						<h2>Weapon Playstyle</h2>
						<div class="playstyle-grid">
							<div class="playstyle-card strengths">
								<h3>Strengths</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Provides consistent buffs and debuffs for prolonged engagements</li>
									<li>Capable of AoE damage while supporting the team</li>
									<li>Flexible and synergizes well with other weapons</li>
									<li>Passive Chip Beat adds no-action pressure once active</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="playstyle-card weaknesses">
								<h3>Weaknesses</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Requires stamina management to maintain songs and deal damage</li>
									<li>Dependent on positioning to maximize Ballad radius</li>
									<li>Vulnerable to Concentration disruption</li>
									<li>Limited burst healing — sustained throughput only via Song Flute Soothing Tones</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<style>
			* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
			:root {
				--forest-dark: #1a2e1a; --forest-green: #2d5016; --moss-green: #4a7c2f;
				--leaf-green: #6b9d3a; --amber: #d4a257; --earth-brown: #5c4033;
				--cream: #f5f1e8; --text-light: #e8e4d8;
			}
			body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--forest-dark); color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.7; min-height: 100vh; }
			.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
			.nav { background: var(--forest-green); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); padding: 1rem 0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
			.nav .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; }
			.logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.2rem; }
			.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
			.nav-links a { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.3s; }
			.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.breadcrumb { padding: 2rem 0 1rem; }
			.breadcrumb a { color: var(--leaf-green); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
			.breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.page-header { padding: 2rem 0 3rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
			.weapon-icon { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-icon img { width: 540px; height: 540px; object-fit: contain; }
			.page-header h1 { font-size: 3rem; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--leaf-green); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.stat-badges { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
			.stat-badge { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
			.content { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
			.weapon-section { background: var(--forest-green); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 2rem; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.weapon-section.highlight { border-color: var(--amber); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-green) 0%, var(--moss-green) 100%); }
			.weapon-section h2 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.weapon-section h3 { color: var(--leaf-green); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; }
			.weapon-section p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.mechanic-details { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 1rem; }
			.attributes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.attribute-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.attribute-card h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.attribute-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.attribute-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			.formula { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--amber); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 600; color: var(--amber); text-align: center; }
			.damage-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--forest-dark); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
			.damage-table th, .damage-table td { padding: 1rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.damage-table th { background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; }
			.damage-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
			.technique-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.technique-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.technique-header h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0; }
			.technique-cost { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
			.flute-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.flute-card.aggressive { border-color: #c74440; }
			.flute-card.defensive { border-color: var(--leaf-green); }
			.flute-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
			.flute-header h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; }
			.flute-tag { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; }
			.playstyle-note { margin-top: 1rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--leaf-green); }
			.playstyle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.playstyle-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.playstyle-card.strengths { border-color: var(--leaf-green); }
			.playstyle-card.weaknesses { border-color: #c74440; }
			.playstyle-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--amber); }
			.playstyle-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.playstyle-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.playstyle-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.nav .container { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
				.nav-links { gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
				.page-header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
				.weapon-section { padding: 1.5rem; }
				.technique-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
				.flute-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.5rem; }
			}
			html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
